# The module's configuration, one file per environment (copied to .env.dev and .env.prod by init).
# A run on this machine reads .env, then .env.dev; .env.prod only with --env prod (12-factor III).
# Real values never enter git: .env.dev / .env.prod / .env.deploy are ignored (ops/config/.gitignore).
# Adoption: kits/stack-kit/docs/ADOPT.md#configuration
